WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.816
Here's what you'll be able to
do by the end of this module,

2
00:00:02.816 --> 00:00:05.100
which takes about fifty
minutes with the lab.

3
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.163
You'll explain what the
audit reads on each instance,

4
00:00:08.163 --> 00:00:12.000
and why it runs only on what Module
1 retained or chose as a target.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.733
You'll rank the audit's findings,

6
00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:16.800
from an enabled S A down to
the Arc-eligibility category.

7
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.656
You'll say what each Arc-eligibility
category means for the next step,

8
00:00:20.656 --> 00:00:24.850
and why engine Entra authentication
doesn't wait for O S level Entra sign-in.

9
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:27.865
And you'll explain why a single
audit run can't show drift,

10
00:00:27.865 --> 00:00:30.225
and where the engine's
service account goes.

11
00:00:30.225 --> 00:00:32.620
Before you start, finish Module 1.
